#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ag_project_profitability.field_project_project__ag_timesheet_cost
msgid "Timesheet cost"
msgstr "Coût des heures"

#. module: ag_project_profitability
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ag_project_profitability.edit_project_ag_profitability
msgid ""
"Timesheet cost uses the hourly cost of each employee. Revenue and other "
"costs come from the analytic account of the project (invoices and vendor "
"bills with that analytic distribution)."
msgstr ""
"Le coût des heures utilise le coût horaire de chaque employé. Le chiffre "
"d'affaires et les autres coûts viennent du compte analytique du projet "
"(factures clients et factures fournisseurs portant cette distribution "
"analytique)."
